A continuous jog asked again at a lower speed while it runs, as halui
does when halui.axis.jog-speed or halui.joint.jog-speed changes while a
jog pin is held: the speed comes down to the new one within the
acceleration limit.  A joint jog in free mode and a world jog in teleop
mode, every servo cycle sampled, on the trapezoid and on the S-curve
planner.
